sequenceDiagram
    participant Client as External Client
    participant TLS as kube-rbac-proxy<br/>8443/TCP TLS
    participant AuthN as Authentication<br/>(OIDC or TokenReview)
    participant AuthZ as Authorization<br/>(Metrics+Static+SAR)
    participant Proxy as Reverse Proxy
    participant Upstream as Upstream App<br/>8080/TCP HTTP
    participant K8sAPI as Kubernetes API<br/>6443/TCP HTTPS

    Note over Client,Upstream: Authenticated Request Flow

    Client->>TLS: HTTPS Request<br/>Port 8443, TLS 1.2+
    TLS->>TLS: TLS Termination<br/>(cert hot-reload, FIPS crypto)

    alt allow-paths check passes
        TLS->>AuthN: Forward to auth chain

        alt ignore-paths match
            AuthN-->>Proxy: Bypass auth (ignored path)
        else OIDC mode configured
            AuthN->>AuthN: Validate OIDC token locally
        else Delegated mode (default)
            AuthN->>K8sAPI: TokenReview<br/>POST /apis/authentication.k8s.io/v1/tokenreviews
            K8sAPI-->>AuthN: TokenReview Response<br/>(authenticated: true/false)
        end

        AuthN->>AuthZ: Authenticated request

        alt Hardcoded metrics authorizer
            AuthZ->>AuthZ: Check OpenShift<br/>monitoring identity
        else Static policy authorizer
            AuthZ->>AuthZ: Check file-based<br/>policy rules
        else SAR authorizer
            AuthZ->>K8sAPI: SubjectAccessReview<br/>POST /apis/authorization.k8s.io/v1/subjectaccessreviews
            K8sAPI-->>AuthZ: SAR Response<br/>(allowed: true/false)
        end

        AuthZ->>Proxy: Authorized request +<br/>auth headers injected
        Proxy->>Upstream: HTTP forward<br/>localhost:8080
        Upstream-->>Proxy: Response
        Proxy-->>Client: HTTPS Response
    else allow-paths check fails
        TLS-->>Client: 403 Forbidden
    end

    Note over Client,Upstream: Health Check Flow (Separate Port)

    Client->>TLS: GET /healthz<br/>proxy-endpoints port, TLS
    TLS-->>Client: 200 OK<br/>(no auth required)
